@Support.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080
@CustomerId = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa

### Create ticket
POST {{Support.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-User: {{CustomerId}}

{
  "subject": "Cannot sign in",
  "description": "The verification code is rejected.",
  "priority": "Normal"
}

### List current user's tickets
GET {{Support.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tickets
X-Demo-User: {{CustomerId}}

### OpenAPI document
GET {{Support.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
